"native-procedure at a procedure type of no convention said, the
 program's own, which Fixpt takes as native; KFX says it, (subr (conv
 native) ...), so that no procedure of its own is one (C116)."
(define make (subr (maxeff (alloc @heap) (io native)) () (subr pure (int int) int))
  (lambda ()
    (the (subr pure (int int) int)
         (native-procedure (seal-code (the (bloblet (fields) @heap) (make-bloblet 8)))))))
